2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] Details:
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] - Strict mode is triggered when the active model has "strict": true in modelspecs.json, or when the
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] model uses the v1/responses endpoint. In that case relay() builds payload.messages with
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] strictHistory(), which keeps roles and prefixes each message with [source] (e.g. [user], [model],
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] etc.), and preserves tool_calls.
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] - Otherwise it uses plainHistory() (or multiHistory() for multimodal).
