2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] The “Feel free to comment if shared files are new or different.” line is a nudge added after a file
2025-11-03 15:36:03 [gpt-5-2025] share/commit changed (“dirty”) so you can add context; safe to ignore if not needed.
