2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - Host key loading: reads from ~/.ssh/id_rsa (rsaPath). If missing or unreadable, startup may fail.
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - Path handling: builds HostDir with HOME/HOMEPATH; Windows paths use forward slashes, which Deno
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] handles but might surprise on some shells.
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - NDJSON flow: /announce and JSON blocks get forwarded to Fountain; non-JSON lines are treated as
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] chat input.
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - Client handling: per-session 관리 via SSHSession; supports PTY, env vars, and shell input.
