2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] key is missing.
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - Graceful shutdown: ensure server.close() and all sessions end cleanly on SIGINT/exit.
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] - Typing: many any types (session, stream). Introduce interfaces for SSHSession and fountain
2025-11-03 16:05:32 [gpt-5-nano] interface to improve type safety.
