2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4] Looking at the JSONParser::parseJSON crash in `json.h:313`, the issue is in the main parsing loop:
2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4] 
2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4] 
2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4] while(true){
