2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4]     }
2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4]     wchar_t ch=js[pos++];  // <-- crash happens here at line 313
2025-11-04 07:32:58 [claude-sonnet-4] 
