2025-11-04 09:19:02 [kimi-k2-0905] Most common fix: make sure the JSON you send to the webhook/API is a single object, not a
2025-11-04 09:19:02 [kimi-k2-0905] string, and the `embeds` value is an array.
2025-11-04 09:19:02 [kimi-k2-0905] 
