2025-11-04 10:50:25 [deepseek-chat] 💡 Bonus: .NET's `UrlPathEncode` vs `UrlEncode`
2025-11-04 10:50:25 [deepseek-chat] - UrlEncode: `+` → space, encodes spaces as `+`
