2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] per 1,000 tokens)
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] - Per-token costs:
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano]   - Input tokens: 0.05 / 1000 = 0.00005 USD per token
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano]   - Cached input tokens: 0.025 / 1000 = 0.000025 USD per token
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano]   - Output tokens: 0.20 / 1000 = 0.00020 USD per token
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] 
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] How the cost is calculated (as in the code):
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] - spent = max(inputTokens - cachedTokens, 0)
2025-11-04 11:51:31 [gpt-5-nano] - cost = spent  0.05/1e6 + outputTokens  0.20/1e6 + cachedTokens * 0.025/1e6
