2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] Easy fixes:
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. Prefix with something un-missable:
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905]    `const line = "⚠  " + error;`   // or “⚠ FAIL:”
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
