2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. Or tag the history entry itself:
2025-11-04 12:54:07 [kimi-k2-0905]    `rohaHistory.push({role:"system", name:"PORT", content:error});`
