2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] We can inject whatever context we have.
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] Inside the loop we already know:
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] - the raw error string
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] - which routine pushed it (we’re inside the flush/remoteBuffer handler)
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] - the current model & user (`rohaModel`, `rohaUser`)
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] - the local timestamp (`slopmark()`)
2025-11-04 12:58:20 [kimi-k2-0905] 
