2025-11-04 16:27:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 16:27:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. Make sure the server process is still alive and listening.
2025-11-04 16:27:13 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Add a keep-alive or heartbeat on the socket so middle-boxes don’t time it out.
