2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] In sloppylisten.ts the exit path is:
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. User types “exit”
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. `onShell` sees the CR, `onEnter()` is called
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. `onEnter` matches “exit”, prints “Goodbye!\r\n” and calls `this.stream?.end()`
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 4. `stream.on("end")` fires → `connection.end()` runs
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 5. `connection.end()` deletes the session from the `connections` map and logs “Session closed”
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] No other cleanup is required; the SSH client socket is closed automatically when the stream ends.
2025-11-04 17:18:49 [kimi-k2-0905] 
