2025-11-04 17:19:52 [kimi-k2-0905] Correct—your SSH lands in sloppylisten (port 6669), which is just a relay.
2025-11-04 17:19:52 [kimi-k2-0905] It forwards NDJSON to slopfountain’s TCP listener on 8081; none of the SSH code runs inside the
2025-11-04 17:19:52 [kimi-k2-0905] main Fountain process.
