2025-11-04 17:44:01 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-04 17:44:01 [kimi-k2-0905] That’s the only place local console input is persisted; everything else (SSH, Discord, etc.)
2025-11-04 17:44:01 [kimi-k2-0905] arrives later via the TCP port and is logged by the same `logForge` call inside the port-handler
