2025-11-06 07:49:27 [scudmarks@discord] can i add an emspace to guarantee an emoji column width?
2025-11-06 07:49:29 [qwen3-coder-plus] No, emojis don't align with em spaces in monospace. Emojis use variable width and don't respect
2025-11-06 07:49:29 [qwen3-coder-plus] text spacing. For emoji columns, use fixed-width blocks:
2025-11-06 07:49:29 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] const Block="█";
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] const FullBlock="█";
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] const EmptyBlock="░";
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] Or pad with regular spaces and accept emojis will appear centered rather than aligned. Discord's
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] emoji rendering overrides text spacing rules.
2025-11-06 07:49:30 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
