2025-11-06 07:53:44 [qwen3-coder-plus] console.log('|A\u200DB|');  // may misalign
2025-11-06 07:53:44 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:53:44 [qwen3-coder-plus] 
2025-11-06 07:53:44 [qwen3-coder-plus] ZWJ can shift visual positioning in fixed-width contexts when joining symbols.
