2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] Pick one:
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 1. Passwords – use bcrypt, sessions in signed cookies, rate-limit with express-rate-limit.
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 2. Magic links – email a JWT that logs the user in once.
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. OAuth2 – Google / GitHub / Apple via passport.js or next-auth.
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 4. WebAuthn / Passkeys – fingerprint / FaceID, no passwords stored.
2025-11-07 07:22:44 [kimi-k2-0905] 5. SAML / OIDC – if you need enterprise SSO.
