2025-11-08 09:13:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-08 09:13:07 [kimi-k2-0905] e845b04 [PORT] !Slop Fountain has crashed … Windows stdio in console mode does not support writing non-UTF-8 byte sequences
2025-11-08 09:13:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-08 09:13:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
