2025-11-10 09:56:11 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-10 09:56:11 [deepseek-chat] 1. Training Data Cutoff: Both models were trained on data that ended before 2025, so they
2025-11-10 09:56:11 [deepseek-chat] "hallucinate" current dates
