2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] Neither of us stepped back and said:
2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] “Wait—slopfountain already rebuilds that block every call; just drop a live timestamp in it.”
2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] In other words, we all missed the obvious leverage point that was sitting in your own code path. A
2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] humbling reminder that even language-models can overlook the simplest solution when the framing
2025-11-10 10:09:24 [kimi-k2-0905] narrows our search space.
