2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] • The Problem:*
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] - `strictHistory()` expects `role: "tool"` entries in the history
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] - But the tool results might be getting stored as `role: "system"` with a special title instead
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] - Or the tool role entries might not be created at all
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] • Check if tool results are properly stored:*
