2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] • Fix:*
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] Change the tool result storage in `processToolCalls()` to use `role: "tool"` instead of `role:
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] "system"`:
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] // In processToolCalls(), change this:
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] const item = {role: "system", title: "ToolCall:"+id, tool_call_id: id, content};
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] // To this:
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] const item = {role: "tool", tool_call_id: id, name: result.name, content};
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-11-15 12:57:26 [deepseek-chat] This will make `strictHistory()` work correctly with tool calls.
