2025-11-18 06:50:32 [kimi-k2-0905] No.
2025-11-18 06:50:32 [kimi-k2-0905] A guild text channel has no exposed member list—only the guild itself does.
2025-11-18 06:50:32 [kimi-k2-0905] A GroupDM (or its partial) is a separate channel type that does expose
2025-11-18 06:50:32 [kimi-k2-0905] `recipients`, but it is not a text channel in the guild sense and will never be the
2025-11-18 06:50:32 [kimi-k2-0905] value of `openChannel` if you’re working inside a server.
