2025-11-21 10:10:21 [gemini-3-pro] connections or during rapid I/O. All connections share the single global `rxBuffer` and the
2025-11-21 10:10:21 [gemini-3-pro] stateful `rxDecoder`.
2025-11-21 10:10:21 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-21 10:10:21 [gemini-3-pro] Here is a fix for `slopprompt.ts` to isolate memory per read and decoder state per connection.
