2025-11-27 06:45:42 [kimi-k2-0905]     volumes: [./src:/src]
2025-11-27 06:45:42 [kimi-k2-0905]     networks: [front]
2025-11-27 06:45:42 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 06:45:42 [kimi-k2-0905]   nginx:
