2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905]     networks: [front]
2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905]     depends_on: [oauth2-proxy, deno_a]
2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905] networks:
2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905]   front:
2025-11-27 06:45:43 [kimi-k2-0905] 
