2025-11-27 06:49:50 [kimi-k2-0905] 3. Create `/etc/authelia/users.yml`
2025-11-27 06:49:50 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 06:49:50 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 06:49:50 [kimi-k2-0905] users:
2025-11-27 06:49:50 [kimi-k2-0905]   alice:
