2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] # 32-byte session secret
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] openssl rand -hex 32
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] # 32-byte client secret
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] openssl rand -hex 32
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-27 07:14:08 [kimi-k2-0905] Paste the two hex strings into the file and restart Authelia.
