2025-11-27 11:12:51 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-27 11:12:51 [gemini-3-pro] • `bomb` is the better choice.*
2025-11-27 11:12:51 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-27 11:12:51 [gemini-3-pro] • Taxonomy: `bomb` clearly represents the genus Bombus (Bumblebees).
