2025-11-27 11:17:16 [gemini-3-pro] `bomb` is the preferred code. It is the standard 4-letter abbreviation for the genus
2025-11-27 11:17:16 [gemini-3-pro] Bombus. `boml` appears to be a non-standard duplicate or typo (possibly intended for
2025-11-27 11:17:16 [gemini-3-pro] Bombus lucorum, which would be `bluc`, or just a variant of `bomb`).
2025-11-27 11:17:16 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-27 11:17:16 [gemini-3-pro] I have removed `boml` to clean up the Hymenoptera list.
