2025-11-28 12:20:32 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-11-28 12:20:32 [kimi-k2-0905] static uint32_t capture_buf[PIXELS_PER_FRAME / 2]; // two pixels per 32-bit word
2025-11-28 12:20:32 [kimi-k2-0905] 
