2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] Search for: "Multi-turn Cermet Trimmer Potentiometer" (e.g., Bourns 3296W series or 3006P).
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Value: 10k $\Omega$
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Why: Multi-turn allows precise voltage calibration for the video levels. The "3386P" you
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] listed is a single-turn; it will work but is harder to fine-tune.
