2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • 1. Power Distribution*
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 VCC: Connect to 5V.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 GND: Connect to Common Ground.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 VEE: Connect to Common Ground (Single supply operation).
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Pico: Powered via USB or VSYS (Logic is 3.3V).
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • 2. Video Input Stage*
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • RCA Center Pin: Connect to the Non-Inverting Input (+) of ALL 4
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] comparator gates.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • RCA Outer/Shield: Connect to Ground.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Termination: 75 $\Omega$ resistor between RCA Center Pin and Ground.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • 3. Reference Thresholds (Inverting Inputs)*
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • CSYNC Comparator (- Input): Connect to the center of your fixed voltage divider (Target
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] approx 0.3V).
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • G0, G1, G2 Comparators (- Inputs): Connect the Wiper (Middle pin) of the 10k
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] Trimmers to these inputs respectively.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro]        Trimmer Leg 1:* Connect to 5V.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro]        Trimmer Leg 2:* Connect to Ground.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • 4. Output Stage (Level Shifting)*
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 Outputs: Connect directly to 4 separate Pico GPIO pins.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] • Pull-up Resistors (Critical): Connect a 2.2k $\Omega$ - 4.7k $\Omega$ resistor from
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] each LM319 Output pin to the Pico 3.3V (3V3_OUT) pin.
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro]        Note:* Do not pull up to 5V. The LM319 is Open Collector; pulling up to 3.3V
2025-11-28 13:21:38 [gemini-3-pro] safely translates the 5V comparator logic to the 3.3V Pico inputs without extra level shifting
2025-11-28 13:21:39 [gemini-3-pro] components.
