2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 3: GND (Logic Ground)
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 4: Input 1 (+) Non-Inverting
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 5: Input 1 (-) Inverting
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 6: V- (Negative Supply)
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 7: Output 1
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 8: GND (Logic Ground)
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 9: Input 2 (+) Non-Inverting
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 10: Input 2 (-) Inverting
2025-11-28 13:44:02 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 11: V+ (Positive Supply)
