2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] Here are the pin assignments for the LM319 High Speed Dual Comparator in the standard
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] DIP-14 package (commonly sold by retailers like Jaycar).
