2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **2**   │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **3**   │  **GND**       │  Logic Ground (Connect to Ground)                       │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **4**   │  **IN 1 (+)**  │  Comparator 1 Non-Inverting Input                       │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **5**   │  **IN 1 (-)**  │  Comparator 1 Inverting Input                           │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **6**   │  **V-**        │  Negative Supply (Connect to Ground for single supply)  │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **7**   │  **OUT 1**     │  Comparator 1 Output (Open Collector)                   │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **8**   │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **9**   │  **OUT 2**     │  Comparator 2 Output (Open Collector)                   │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **10**  │  **IN 2 (-)**  │  Comparator 2 Inverting Input                           │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **11**  │  **IN 2 (+)**  │  Comparator 2 Non-Inverting Input                       │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **12**  │  **V+**        │  Positive Supply (Connect to +5V)                       │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **13**  │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] │  **14**  │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
