2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] Connection Notes for LUMA 2 (5V Single Supply)
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] • V+ (Pin 12): Connect to your 5V rail.
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] • V- (Pin 6) & GND (Pin 3): Connect both to Ground.
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] • Outputs (Pins 7 & 9): Connect these to the Pico GPIOs. Ensure your pull-up
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] resistors (2.2kΩ - 4.7kΩ) go from these pins to the 3.3V rail (not 5V) to protect the
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] Pico inputs.
2025-11-28 13:49:03 [gemini-3-pro] 
