2025-11-29 08:59:01 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 08:59:01 [claude-opus-4-5] // Problem: double close
2025-11-29 08:59:01 [claude-opus-4-5] stream.close();
2025-11-29 08:59:01 [claude-opus-4-5] // later...
2025-11-29 08:59:01 [claude-opus-4-5] stream.close(); // BadResource
