2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] Actually wait - I said run all 245s at 5V earlier for driving the C64. For inputs to RP2040 you
2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] want:
2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] - 245 powered at 3.3V (outputs safe for RP2040)
2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] - 245 inputs are 5V tolerant on LVC variant
2025-11-29 10:56:21 [claude-opus-4-5] 
