2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] That error typically means the response stream has been closed or corrupted. Common causes:
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] 1. Client disconnected - check if the connection is still alive before writing
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] 2. Stream already closed - the writer may have been closed elsewhere
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] 3. Backpressure not handled - `writer.ready` should be awaited before `write`, not
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] after
2025-11-29 11:54:59 [claude-opus-4-5] 
