2025-11-29 17:11:37 [claude-opus-4-5] - 3.3V to 10K resistor
2025-11-29 17:11:37 [claude-opus-4-5] - 10K resistor to 1K resistor (this junction is your ~0.3V reference)
2025-11-29 17:11:37 [claude-opus-4-5] - 1K resistor to ground
2025-11-29 17:11:37 [claude-opus-4-5] - Junction connects to CSYNC comparator inverting input (-)
