2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] Pico is 51mm x 21mm.
2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] So at 58mm PCB width, the Pico fits nicely across with a few mm margin each side.
