2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] Depends how you orient the Pico - parallel to edge connector or perpendicular?
2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 18:47:17 [claude-opus-4-5] Perpendicular keeps depth short, around 50-55mm total. Parallel would push it to 70-80mm.
