2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] DOT, GP10, 10K series
2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] PHI2, GP28, 10K series
