2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] - 16 address bits via shift registers 1+2
2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] - 8 data bits in via shift register 3
2025-11-29 22:01:25 [claude-opus-4-5] - 8 data bits out via transceiver 5
