2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] • Output Path (RP2040 → C64):*
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - GP2-9 drive data to 74LVC245 A-side (3.3V logic)
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - GP21 controls /OE (output enable)
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - 74LVC245 buffers 3.3V to 5V-tolerant levels on B-side
