2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - GP10-14: Open drain outputs (/IRQ, /NMI, /ROML, /ROMH, /EXROM)
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - GP26-27: Open drain outputs (/GAME, DMA)
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] - GP28-29: Clock inputs with voltage dividers (PHI2, DOT)
