2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] • Timing Critical Path:*
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] PHI2 rising edge → Latch shift registers → Read 32 bits → Decode address → Lookup ROM → Drive GP2-9
2025-11-30 06:56:13 [claude-sonnet-4-5] → Assert GP21 → Data valid on C64 bus
