2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] • Inputs (Reading 5V bus):*
2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] Use Voltage Divider: IEC_PIN (5V) → 2.2kΩ → GPIO → 3.3kΩ → GND.
