2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] • Outputs (Writing to bus):*
2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] Use 2N7000 FET.
2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] Gate: GPIO (via 100Ω). Source: GND. Drain: IEC_PIN.
2025-11-30 08:17:09 [gemini-3-pro] Logic: GPIO High = FET On = Bus Low (Active). GPIO Low = FET Off = Bus High (Passive).
