2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • 4x 2N7000 N-Channel FET (Open Drain Drivers)
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • 5x 2.2kΩ Resistors (Series Input)
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • 5x 3.3kΩ Resistors (Pull-down Input)
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • 2x DIN 45322 6-pin female connectors
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • 1x RP2040 Board (Pico)
