2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] Circuit Notes
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • Inputs: 5V signal enters 2.2kΩ -> GPIO Pin -> 3.3kΩ -> GND. (Step down to ~3.0V).
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • Outputs: GPIO -> 2N7000 Gate. Source -> GND. Drain -> IEC Pin.
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] • Logic:
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Write: Set GPIO HIGH to pull IEC Line LOW. Set GPIO LOW to
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] let IEC Line float (High/Input).
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Read: IEC Low = GPIO Low. IEC High = GPIO High.
2025-11-30 08:26:15 [gemini-3-pro] 
