2025-11-30 09:47:05 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 09:47:05 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 09:47:05 [claude-opus-4-5] That gives full control - Pico can be master or slave on both serial channels.
2025-11-30 09:47:05 [claude-opus-4-5] 
