2025-11-30 12:00:41 [claude-opus-4-5] 1. 74HC165 VCC voltage mismatch - U1 and U2 show `VCC, 5V` but they're feeding GP19/GP20
2025-11-30 12:00:41 [claude-opus-4-5] directly. The 74HC165 outputs will be 5V logic levels going into 3.3V GPIOs without protection.
2025-11-30 12:00:41 [claude-opus-4-5] Either:
