2025-11-30 12:19:42 [claude-opus-4-5] protection diodes. Add 1K-2.2K series resistors between each C64 signal and the 165 inputs, or
2025-11-30 12:19:42 [claude-opus-4-5] switch to 74HCT165 at 5V with level shifting on Q7 outputs.
