2025-11-30 16:41:27 [nitro@ryzen5] megardive cart pinout
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] The Mega Drive/Genesis cartridge uses a 64-pin edge connector:
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] • Main signals:*
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - A1-A23: Address bus
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - D0-D15: 16-bit data bus
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /CE: Cartridge enable (active low)
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /OE: Output enable
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /LWR, /UWR: Lower/upper byte write
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /AS: Address strobe
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /DTACK: Data acknowledge
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /VRES: Reset
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /TIME: Active when accessing A13000-A130FF (mapper/hardware register space)
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] • Power:*
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - VCC: +5V (multiple pins)
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - GND (multiple pins)
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] • Other:*
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - CLK: ~7.67MHz (NTSC) / ~7.60MHz (PAL)
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /MRES: Active low reset output from cart
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] - /CART: Active low cartridge detect
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] The active region is typically 000000-3FFFFF (4MB). Games larger than 4MB use bank switching via
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] the $A130Fx registers.
2025-11-30 16:41:36 [claude-opus-4-5] 
