2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 5. Emulation Cycle Steps
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] Sequence to emulate a ROM read.
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] Step,	Action,	Signals,	Description
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 1,	Wait,	GP9 (bit 0),	Loop until /CE (Cart Enable) is LOW
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 2,	Capture,	GP3 LOW->HIGH,	Latch 165 inputs (Address/Control)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 3,	Shift In,	GP2 Cycles,	Read 8 bits on GP4/5/6 (Address)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 4,	Lookup,	Internal,	Fetch 16-bit word from ROM array
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 5,	Shift Out,	GP10 Cycles,	Clock Data to 595s (GP13/14)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 6,	Latch Out,	GP11 Pulse,	Move data to 595 storage register
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 7,	Drive Bus,	GP12 LOW,	Enable 595 Outputs (D0-D15)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 8,	Ack,	GP16 HIGH,	Pull /DTACK LOW (Data Valid)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 9,	Hold,	GP9 (bit 0),	Wait until /CE or /OE goes HIGH
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 10,	Release,	GP16 LOW,	Release /DTACK (High Z)
2025-11-30 17:32:33 [gemini-3-pro] 11,	Tristate,	GP12 HIGH,	Disable 595 Outputs (High Z)
