2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] Emulation Logic Steps
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] This CSV details the PIO/Core logic flow to emulate a read cycle using the parallel shift
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] architecture.
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] Step,Action,Direction,Signal Details,Notes
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 1,Idle State,Input,Monitor U6 shift stream or INT pin,Wait for /CE (Chip Enable) Low
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 2,Capture Bus,Output,Pulse GP3 (SH/LD) Low then High,Latches current state of A1-A23 D0-D15 and Control into U1-U6
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 3,Read Address,Input,Clock GP2 8 times reading GP4-GP6,Read 24 bits of address in 8 cycles (3 bits width)
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 4,Decode,Internal,Compare Address to ROM Map,Determine 16-bit data word to return
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 5,Load Output,Output,Clock GP10 8 times writing GP13-GP14,Shift 16-bit data word into U7-U8 (2 bits width)
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 6,Present Data,Output,Pulse GP11 (RCLK),Latch data to 595 outputs (Pins Q0-Q7)
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 7,Enable Bus,Output,Set GP12 (/OE) LOW,Enable 74HC595 output drivers onto D0-D15
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 8,Acknowledge,Output,Set GP16 HIGH (FET ON),Pulls Megadrive /DTACK LOW to signal valid data
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 9,Hold,Wait,Wait for /AS or /CE HIGH,Wait for CPU to finish read cycle
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 10,Release,Output,Set GP16 LOW (FET OFF),Release /DTACK (Passive High)
2025-11-30 17:46:11 [gemini-3-pro] 11,Disable Bus,Output,Set GP12 (/OE) HIGH,High-Z the 74HC595 outputs
