2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] • U2 (Addr Mid): Input pins to MD A9-A16. Q7 (9) connects to U3 DS (10).
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] • U3 (Addr Hi): Input pins to MD A17-A23. Q7 (9) connects to U4 DS (10).
