2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] Write Sequence Logic
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  Set Data: Write Low Byte to GP8-15.
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  Latch Low: Pulse GP5 (Low -> High).
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 3.  Set Data: Write High Byte to GP8-15.
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 4.  Latch High: Pulse GP6 (Low -> High).
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 5.  Enable: Set GP7 Low (Drives 5V bus).
2025-11-30 18:27:13 [gemini-3-pro] 6.  Handshake: Assert /DTACK.
