2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] Emulation Logic Steps (Write Cycle)
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  Idle: GP26 (/OE) is HIGH (Outputs High-Z).
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  Load Low: Place lower 8 bits on GP10-GP17. Pulse GP21 (CP Low). Data is now stored in
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] U7.
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 3.  Load High: Place upper 8 bits on GP10-GP17. Pulse GP22 (CP High). Data is now stored in
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] U8.
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 4.  Drive Bus: Set GP26 (/OE) LOW. U7 and U8 drive D0-D15 onto the Megadrive bus.
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 5.  Ack: Assert /DTACK (GP19 High -> FET Low).
2025-11-30 18:31:49 [gemini-3-pro] 6.  Release: After bus cycle ends, set GP26 (/OE) HIGH and release /DTACK.
