2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • Common Data Bus (Pico to Latches)*
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP10 → U7 Pin 3 (D0) AND U8 Pin 3 (D0)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP11 → U7 Pin 4 (D1) AND U8 Pin 4 (D1)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP12 → U7 Pin 7 (D2) AND U8 Pin 7 (D2)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP13 → U7 Pin 8 (D3) AND U8 Pin 8 (D3)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP14 → U7 Pin 13 (D4) AND U8 Pin 13 (D4)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP15 → U7 Pin 14 (D5) AND U8 Pin 14 (D5)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP16 → U7 Pin 17 (D6) AND U8 Pin 17 (D6)
2025-11-30 18:42:33 [gemini-3-pro] • GP17 → U7 Pin 18 (D7) AND U8 Pin 18 (D7)
