2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] You have the logical allocation for the latches, but the specific Netlist entries for U7
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] and U8 (the 74LS374s) were missing from the text.
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] Additionally, there are two inconsistencies to resolve before building:
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  Clock Pin: The text lists GP28 for `MD_CLK`, but the software module exports
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] GP26.
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  Chip ID: The "Shift Registers" section references `ALL_595` (Serial-to-Parallel), but
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] your BOM and GPIO allocation (Parallel Data Out GP10-GP17) are designed for 74LS374
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] (Parallel-to-Parallel).
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] Here is the missing Netlist for the 74LS374s using the standard SOIC/DIP pinout. Note that
2025-11-30 18:46:43 [gemini-3-pro] inputs/outputs on the '374 are not sequential.
