2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] # Project Crumpet
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] A 16bit Sega Megadrive RP2040 hookup on plated 64 finger edge connector.
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] [USB] ─ RP2040 ─ 10kΩ series resistors ─ 6×74HC165 and 2x74LVC245 ─ cartridge port ─ [Megadrive]
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] # description
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] Gangs of shift registers transport data between millenium.
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] ## basic rom cartridge logic
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] The RP2040 PIO empties shift registers in parallel = 8 cycles.
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] With address decoded and confirmation write cycle required, 16 bit data is prepared for bus.
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] The PIO writes 8 bits, latches the Low byte, writes 8 bits, latches the High byte, then enables Output (/OE).
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] # bom
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 6× 74HC165 shiftin registers, reading from 68K → RP2040, A1–A23 + D0–D15 and 8 control states, ($2.10/$12.60)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 2× 74LS374 buffered latches, write from RP2040 → 68K drives D0–D15 ($5.60,$11.20)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 2x 2N7000 N-Channel FET, assert low from RP2040 → C64 control signals (/DTACK /CART)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 2x edge connection plating, 32-pin top and bottom gold fingers
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 5x 100nF ceramic cap, (decoupling), ~$0.50
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] * 2x 20-pin female header, Pico socket, ~$1.00
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] # GPIO connections
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] For driving 5V Open Drain GPIO should Toggle between Output LOW and Input/High-Z with 2N7000
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] For reading 5V static input protect GPIO with 10K in series
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] For reading 5V CLK use 2.2K series + 3.3K to GND voltage divider
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] ## Megadrive Pinout
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - A1-A23: Address bus
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - D0-D15: 16-bit data bus
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /CE: Cartridge enable (active low)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /OE: Output enable
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /LWR, /UWR: Lower/upper byte write
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /AS: Address strobe
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /DTACK: Data acknowledge
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /VRES: Reset
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /TIME: Active when accessing A13000-A130FF (mapper/hardware register space)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - VCC: +5V (multiple pins)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - GND (multiple pins)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - CLK: ~7.67MHz (NTSC) / ~7.60MHz (PAL)
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /MRES: Active low reset output from cart
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] - /CART: Active low cartridge detect
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] ## GPIO Allocation
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP0, UART TX
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP1, UART RX
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP2, shift CLK
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP3, shift SH/LD
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP4, shift Q7 A0-A7
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP5, shift Q7 A8-A15
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP6, shift Q7 A16-A23
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP7, shift Q7 D0-D7
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP8, shift Q7 D8-D15
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP9, shift Q7 Controls
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP10, latch D0, out
2025-11-30 19:10:04 [gemini-3-pro] GP11, latch D1, out
