2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] Case Observation: Audio Filtering
2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] Since you are outputting PWM (Digital 3.3V square wave) to the Megadrive Audio Input pins (B1 and
2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] B3), you should update the BOM to include a simple RC Low Pass Filter for each channel.
2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] Without this, you are feeding raw high-frequency logic noise into the console mixer.
2025-11-30 19:23:47 [gemini-3-pro] 
