2025-11-30 19:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] - /VRES: Reset
2025-11-30 19:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] - /TIME: Active when accessing A13000-A130FF
2025-11-30 19:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] - VCC: +5V
2025-11-30 19:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] - GND: Ground
2025-11-30 19:34:25 [gemini-3-pro] - CLK: ~7.67MHz (NTSC) / ~7.60MHz (PAL)
