2025-12-01 06:53:42 [nitro@ryzen5] pinout for gba cart
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] GBA cartridge is 32-pin (top and bottom):
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] ╭───────┬────────┬───────┬────────╮
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  Pin  │  Name  │  Pin  │  Name  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] ├───────┼────────┼───────┼────────┤
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  1    │  VCC   │  17   │  VCC   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  2    │  PHI   │  18   │  AD0   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  3    │  /WR   │  19   │  AD1   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  4    │  /RD   │  20   │  AD2   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  5    │  /CS   │  21   │  AD3   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  6    │  AD4   │  22   │  AD8   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  7    │  AD5   │  23   │  AD9   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  8    │  AD6   │  24   │  AD10  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  9    │  AD7   │  25   │  AD11  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  10   │  AD12  │  26   │  AD16  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  11   │  AD13  │  27   │  AD17  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  12   │  AD14  │  28   │  AD18  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  13   │  AD15  │  29   │  AD19  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  14   │  AD20  │  30   │  AD22  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  15   │  AD21  │  31   │  AD23  │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] │  16   │  GND   │  32   │  GND   │
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] ╰───────┴────────┴───────┴────────╯
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] Key points:
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] - 3.3V native - no level shifting needed for RP2040
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] - AD0-AD15 multiplexed address/data bus (active low /RD latches address, then data appears)
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] - AD16-AD23 address only
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] - PHI is ~16.78MHz system clock
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] - /CS active when accessing ROM space
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] Much simpler interface than Megadrive - direct GPIO connection possible without shift registers if
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] you have enough pins.
2025-12-01 06:53:52 [claude-opus-4-5] 
