2025-12-01 07:11:11 [claude-opus-4-5] Physical connector is proprietary Nintendo - 6 pin with keying notch.
2025-12-01 07:11:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 07:11:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 3.3V native, SPI-like protocol. Direct GPIO connection to Pico possible - simpler than waffle even.
