2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] ├───────┼─────────────────────────┼─────────────────┤
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  1    │  Up                     │  -              │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  2    │  Down                   │  -              │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  3    │  Left / Ground          │  -              │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  4    │  Right / Ground         │  -              │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  5    │  +5V                    │  +5V            │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  6    │  Button B/A / TX        │  TX             │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  7    │  Select                 │  -              │
2025-12-01 07:19:06 [claude-opus-4-5] │  8    │  Ground                 │  Ground         │
