2025-12-01 07:36:19 [claude-opus-4-5] Options:
2025-12-01 07:36:19 [claude-opus-4-5] 1. Base luma2: 3 trimpots for G0, G1, G2
2025-12-01 07:36:19 [claude-opus-4-5] 2. Extended: 5 trimpots for finer grey level control
