2025-12-01 11:07:27 [claude-opus-4-5] "DB9 right angle PCB mount through hole"
2025-12-01 11:07:27 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:07:27 [claude-opus-4-5] or
2025-12-01 11:07:27 [claude-opus-4-5] 
