2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 1. GPIO shortage - 4 joysticks × 5 lines = 20 GPIOs for input alone. You're using GP2-GP21
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] which leaves little room for output driving. The CD4066 switches help but need control lines too.
