2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 2. CD4066 control - Not yet allocated. Need 4 GPIOs minimum to select which input routes to
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] which output.
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 3. Output driving - The 4× DE9 male outputs need GPIO allocation or mux logic.
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] Options:
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] • A) Shift register approach* - Add 74HC165 for reading, 74HC595 for driving outputs. Frees
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] GPIOs for CD4066 control.
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] • B) Reduce scope* - 2 inputs, 2 outputs active at once, directly switched.
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] • C) I2C expander* - MCP23017 gives 16 extra GPIOs.
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] Which direction interests you?
2025-12-01 11:32:11 [claude-opus-4-5] 
