2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] Use 3× 74HC595 shift registers for digital outputs. Active low, accent open drain with ULN2803 if
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] needed for 5V.
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] • Analog out: 6 axes*
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] Tricky. Options:
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] ╭───────────────────┬───────────────────┬─────────────────────────╮
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] │  Method           │  Parts            │  Notes                  │
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] ├───────────────────┼───────────────────┼─────────────────────────┤
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] │  PWM + RC filter  │  6× resistor/cap  │  Simple, slow response  │
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] │  MCP4728          │  1× I2C quad DAC  │  4 channels, 12-bit     │
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] │  MCP4922          │  2× SPI dual DAC  │  6 channels total       │
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] │  Digital pot      │  3× MCP4251       │  Emulates 100K paddle   │
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] ╰───────────────────┴───────────────────┴─────────────────────────╯
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] Soundblaster expects 555 timing (resistance to capacitor charge). Digital pot is most authentic.
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:10:03 [claude-opus-4-5] Apple II paddles same principle - 558 timer reads resistance.
