2025-12-01 12:34:33 [nitro@ryzen5] 74HC4066 Quad bilateral analog switch ICNZ$0.84
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Good part. 74HC4066 has 4 independent analog switches, each with control pin.
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] • Option A: Direct GPIO control*
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 4× 74HC4066 = 16 switches
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 4 outputs × 4 lines (Up/Dn/Lt/Rt) = 16 switches
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Fire buttons need extra chip
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 5 GPIOs per joystick = 20 GPIOs total
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Too many GPIOs.
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] • Option B: Shift register + 4066*
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 3× 74HC595 shift out → controls 4× 74HC4066
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 24 control lines available
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 4 outputs × 5 lines = 20 switches used
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 3 GPIOs (CLK/LATCH/DATA)
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Clean. 595 outputs go high/low, 4066 passes or blocks.
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] • Option C: Direct 595 drive*
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 3× 74HC595 directly drive output pins
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] No 4066 needed
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Active low via inverter or ULN2803
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] Simpler but needs current sink for accent 5V loads.
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] • Recommendation:* Option B
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 595 controls 4066 switches. 4066 passes accent 5V from target machine through to accent accent GND
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] when active. No level shifting needed, bidirectional capable.
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
