2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] GP6, shift out LATCH
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] GP7, shift out DATA
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-01 12:34:47 [claude-opus-4-5] 
