2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] - Uses multiplexing (select line on pin 7) to read extra buttons
2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] - But still active low - pressed = ground
2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] • Project Joy design:*
2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] - 10kΩ pull-ups on all shift register inputs
2025-12-01 15:18:50 [deepseek-chat] - Consistent active-low logic across all 4 ports
