2025-12-01 15:36:08 [nitro@ryzen5] can U8 Q4 and Q5 go to the Apple resonators or whatever they were called
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] Yes! U8 Q4 and Q5 can drive Apple II paddle buttons (often called "fire buttons" on
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] paddles).
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] • Apple II paddle connections:*
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Paddles typically have one fire button each
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Two paddles = two button inputs needed
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Uses the same active-low logic as joysticks
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] 
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] • Updated U8 allocation:*
