2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Q4: Apple Paddle1 Button
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Q5: Apple Paddle2 Button
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Q6: NC
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] - Q7: NC
2025-12-01 15:36:17 [deepseek-chat] 
