2025-12-01 15:47:40 [gemini-3-pro] • Apple Output: Latch U8 drives Annunciators (AN0-AN3).
2025-12-01 15:47:40 [gemini-3-pro] • CD4051 Pinout: Corrected to standard DIP-16.
2025-12-01 15:47:40 [gemini-3-pro] • BOOTSEL: Can be used as a user button (e.g., Mode Select).
