2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] RP2040 multi-joystick hub with ribbon breakouts.
2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] Capable of remote drving 4x Atari/C64/Sega ports from DE9 connectors.
2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 15:53:54 [gemini-3-pro] Multiple select cycles possible for Sega style 12 buttons joypads.
