2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] Summary of "New/Different"
2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  LUMA2's Chroma Mod: Attempting to decode PAL/NTSC color phase using pure GPIO edge
2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] counting on an MCU is very rare; usually, a dedicated video decoder chip is used.
2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  Crumpet's Architecture: A "Shift Register Bus" for a 16-bit console is a distinct
2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] architectural choice that differs from the standard "Direct GPIO" or "External Memory Interface"
2025-12-01 17:54:22 [gemini-3-pro] approaches seen in other RP2040 projects (like the PicoGUS or various GBA dumpers).
