2025-12-01 18:22:08 [gemini-3-pro] • DIN Sockets: Project Fifteen requires DIN-6. Jaycar often stocks DIN-5 (MIDI
2025-12-01 18:22:08 [gemini-3-pro] style), but DIN-6 (Commodore Serial) can be harder to find on the shelf.
