2025-12-01 18:53:12 [nitro@ryzen5] does luma2 have any spare gpio?
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] Yes, Project LUMA2 has a significant number of spare GPIO pins.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] Because the video capture logic relies heavily on the PIO state machines and a specific block of
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] input pins (GP16–GP22), the lower GPIO block is almost entirely untouched.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] GPIO Status
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • Used / Reserved:*
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP0, GP1: UART (Debug)
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP16–GP21: Video Inputs (Sync + Luma bits)
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP22: Chroma Input (Mod)
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP26: Audio Input (ADC Mod)
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP23, GP24, GP25: Internal (Power save, VBUS, LED)
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • Spare / Available:*
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP2 – GP15: (14 pins) - High Speed Digital
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]        Ideal for:* SD Card (SPI), Buttons, OLED Display (I2C), or a parallel output bus.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP27: (ADC1) - Analog/Digital
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]        Ideal for:* Additional audio channel (Stereo mod) or Potentiometer.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP28: (ADC2) - Analog/Digital
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] • GP29: (ADC3) - Analog/Digital (Often used for VSYS monitoring on Pico, but
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] available on raw RP2040 or some boards).
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] Potential Upgrades with Spares
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] With 14+ spare digital pins and 2 spare analog pins, you could add:
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  SD Card Interface (SPI):
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Requires 4 pins (RX, TX, SCK, CS).
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]        Use:* Save captured screenshots or video locally.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  User Interface:
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]     *   I2C OLED Screen (2 pins) + Navigation Buttons (3 pins).
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]        Use:* Adjust capture thresholds digitally instead of using trimpots, or display the
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] current frame rate/resolution.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 3.  Stereo Audio:
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Use GP27 for the second audio channel.
2025-12-01 18:53:42 [gemini-3-pro] 
