2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] This HAT uses 13 GPIO pins (SPI screen + Joystick + Buttons), sitting right in the middle
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] of your previous Luma2 layout.
