2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] You have the comparators and passives. To support the new features:
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  Waveshare Pico-LCD-1.14 (The HAT version with joystick).
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  1x Extra LM319 (Total 3 chips):
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Chip 1: Sync + Chroma.
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro]     *   Chip 2: G0 + G1.
