2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro]        (Note: For G4 you might need a 4th comparator or use a single op-amp/comparator, or
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] stick to 16 colors/4-bit luma).*
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] 3.  Audio Input: 2x 10uF Capacitors (AC coupling) + 2x 10k/10k voltage dividers (to bias
2025-12-01 18:59:21 [gemini-3-pro] the ADC input to 1.65V center).
