2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] 
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - peek (C64 PEEK command, also viewing)
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - scope
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - phosphor
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - scanline
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - chroma (if keeping the chroma mod)
2025-12-02 14:12:18 [claude-opus-4-5] - 1701p (p for pico)
