2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] Here is a review of the Luma2 SKUs and a design for the "Control Deck" daughterboard
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] (Ribbon + 5 Pots + LEDs).
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] SKU Verdict: The 2" is "Cuter"
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] For a Mini Commodore 1701 replica:
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Waveshare 2" (Pico-LCD-2): Best choice. The physical bezel/buttons match the aesthetic of
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] a monitor control panel.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Waveshare 2.8" (ResTouch): Rejected. It uses GP16-GP22 for the LCD/Touch
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] interface, which strictly conflicts with your high-speed comparator inputs (G0-G4). You would have
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] no pins left for video capture.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] New Sub-Assembly: Luma2 Control Deck
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] A separate front-panel PCB connected via ribbon cable.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Features:*
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  5x Piher Trimpots: Adjust thresholds for Sync, G0, G1, G2, G3/4.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  5x LEDs: Visual feedback.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro]        Mode A (Power/Status):* Static glow (retro aesthetic).
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro]        Mode B (Calibration - Recommended):* LEDs driven by the Comparator Outputs. They
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] flicker when that specific grey level is detected. Makes tuning the trimpots intuitive without an
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] oscilloscope.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 3.  Connection: 14-pin IDC Ribbon Cable.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] Control Deck BOM
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 1x PCB (Front Panel strip)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 5x 10k Piher Horizontal Trimpots
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 5x 3mm LEDs (Green for Luma, Red for Sync)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 5x 330Ω Resistors (LED current limiting)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 1x 14-pin IDC Male Header (Right Angle)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • 1x 14-pin IDC Ribbon Cable assembly
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] Ribbon Pinout (Main Board ↔ Control Deck)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 1: 5V (Pot Top)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 2: GND (Pot Bottom & LED Cathodes)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 3: Wiper 1 (Sync Threshold) → To Comparator (-)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 4: Wiper 2 (G0 Threshold) → To Comparator (-)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 5: Wiper 3 (G1 Threshold) → To Comparator (-)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 6: Wiper 4 (G2 Threshold) → To Comparator (-)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 7: Wiper 5 (G3/4 Threshold) → To Comparator (-)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 8: LED 1 Drive (Sync) ← From Comparator Output (Buffered) or GPIO
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 9: LED 2 Drive (G0)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 10: LED 3 Drive (G1)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 11: LED 4 Drive (G2)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 12: LED 5 Drive (G3/4)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Pin 13/14: GND/Shielding
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] Updated GPIO Allocation (Pico-LCD-2 Compatible)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • To accommodate the Waveshare 2" LCD, we must move the capture pins away from the LCD SPI and
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] Button pins.*
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Constraints:*
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • LCD uses: GP8, 9, 10, 11, 12, 13
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • LCD Buttons use: GP2, 3, 15, 17 (Can be ignored/desoldered if needed, but let's try to keep them)
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • New Luma2 Map:*
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Capture Bus (Continuous block preferred for PIO): GP18, 19, 20, 21, 22 are Safe.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Sync: Move from GP14 to GP26 (ADC0 as Digital In) or keep at GP14.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] • Chroma: GP16 conflicts with LCD Button Right. Move to GP27 or GP28.
2025-12-02 15:36:34 [gemini-3-pro] 
