2025-12-02 17:02:00 [gemini-3-pro] `server.js`
2025-12-02 17:02:00 [gemini-3-pro] This script initializes the host, exposes the device registry, and sets up the listener on port
2025-12-02 17:02:00 [gemini-3-pro] 8081.
