2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] Yes, the text specifies the Waveshare Pico LCD 2 (2-inch). It is a 320x240 IPS panel using
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] a 4-wire SPI interface.
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] However, the specifications contain a pin conflict regarding the onboard buttons:
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 1.  Device Section: Maps the LCD buttons to GP14, GP15, GP16, and GP17.
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 2.  Luma2 GPIO Allocation: Maps GP14 to `CSYNC` (Input) and GP16 to
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] `Chroma` (Input).
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] To use this specific SKU for Luma2, you will need to modify the board or ignore the onboard buttons
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] to free up those pins for the LM319 video signals.
2025-12-02 17:04:41 [gemini-3-pro] 
