2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] There is a significant conflict within the Luma2 project options regarding the 2.8"
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] display variant.
