2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] The µ1701-2.8 (Waveshare 2.8") hard-wires its SPI and control lines to pins that your Luma2
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] Netlist assigns to video capture inputs.
