2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] • Conclusion:*
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] The 2" LCD works perfectly with your current GPIO allocation. The 2.8" LCD is
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] incompatible with the Luma2 design as currently specified because it consumes the pins needed for
2025-12-02 17:05:58 [gemini-3-pro] the LM319 comparator outputs (G0–G4) and Chroma signal.
