2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] Conflicts Identified
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • 1. Luma2 Capture Logic vs. 2.8" Display (µ1701-2.8)*
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] The 2.8" screen (Waveshare ResTouch) hardwires its SPI and Control pins to GP16–GP22. This
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] completely overlaps with your video capture inputs:
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • GP16: Needed for Chroma (2.8" uses for DC).
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • GP17: Needed for Key 1 (2.8" uses for CS).
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • GP18–GP22: Needed for Greys G0–G4 (2.8" uses for SPI CLK, MOSI, RST, Touch IRQ,
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] Touch CS).
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • 2. Luma2 Capture Logic vs. 2" Display (1701-2:13)*
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • Status: Compatible.
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • The 2" screen restricts itself to GP8–GP13 (Screen) and GP2, GP3, GP15, GP17
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] (Buttons).
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • This leaves GP14 (Sync), GP16 (Chroma), and GP18–GP22 (Greys) free for
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] your comparators.
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] • Recommendation:* Stick to the 2" SKU for the Luma2 project. The 2.8" SKU would require
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] moving the entire capture array (G0-G4) to low GPIOs (GP0-GP7), losing your UART debug and
2025-12-02 17:08:55 [gemini-3-pro] requiring a complete re-map.
