2025-12-02 18:03:48 [gemini-3-pro] Logic High at IEC (~5V) ≈ 3.0V at GPIO.
2025-12-02 18:03:48 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 18:03:48 [gemini-3-pro] • Outputs (Driving Bus Low):
2025-12-02 18:03:48 [gemini-3-pro] 2N7000 FET: Gate to GPIO, Source to GND, Drain to IEC_PIN.
2025-12-02 18:03:48 [gemini-3-pro] Logic: GPIO HIGH = IEC LOW (Active). GPIO LOW = IEC Floating (Passive High).
