2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] GPIO Logic
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Inputs (Reading 5V Bus):*
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Voltage Divider: IEC_PIN (5V) → 2.2kΩ → GPIO → 3.3kΩ → GND.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Logic High at IEC (~5V) ≈ 3.0V at GPIO.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Outputs (Driving Bus Low):*
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 2N7000 FET: Gate to GPIO, Source to GND, Drain to IEC_PIN.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Logic: GPIO HIGH = IEC LOW (Active). GPIO LOW = IEC Floating (Passive High).
