2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Project LUMA2
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Purpose - capture 2bit monochrome video such as C64 luma pin
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Pico 4 input pins CSYNC G0 G1 G2 Fed by 2 x LM319 featuring 4 fast voltage comparators.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] CSYNC based on fixed threshold, 2 gray and 1 white detector adjustable with trimmers.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] Pico PIO code required to take 4 GPIO digital inputs.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] RP2040 then formats output frames of 320 wide 200 high 50 hz 2 bit monochrome.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
