2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] netlist
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] 
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 VCC: Connect to 5V.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 GND: Connect to Common Ground.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 VEE: Connect to Common Ground (Single supply operation).
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • RCA Center Pin: Connect to the Non-Inverting Input (+) of ALL 4/6 comparator gates.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • RCA Outer/Shield: Connect to Ground.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Termination: between RCA Center Pin and Ground.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • CSYNC Comparator Connect 3V3 rail with voltage divider 10K + 1K to inverting input
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • G0, G1, G2 Comparator - wiper middle pin to comparator inverting input, leg 1 5v leg 2 ground
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • LM319 Outputs: Connect directly to 4 separate Pico GPIO pins with internal pullups.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Place capacitors across the LM319 VCC/GND pins, as close to the chips as possible.
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Bias resistors: Single GPIO through 220K to each trimpot wiper (G0, G1, G2, [G3, G4])
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • 75R termination: RCA center pin to ground
2025-12-02 19:21:54 [gemini-3-pro] • Optional 4.7K pull-ups: LM319 outputs to 3.3V (one per output) instead of internal pullups
