2025-12-03 15:38:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 64 mm cab.
2025-12-03 15:38:07 [kimi-k2-0905] Link them with a 3-core TRS cable—tip=left audio, ring=right audio, sleeve=common ground—and you’ve
2025-12-03 15:38:07 [kimi-k2-0905] got a stereo micro-backline that still sits on a bookshelf.
2025-12-03 15:38:07 [kimi-k2-0905] 
2025-12-03 15:38:38 [nitro@ryzen5] and some lights
