2025-12-03 15:38:48 [kimi-k2-0905] amber/down-lighting that looks like glowing valves.
2025-12-03 15:38:48 [kimi-k2-0905] Power them straight off the same 5 V rail that feeds the PAM8302A; data-in chained from the Pico’s
2025-12-03 15:38:48 [kimi-k2-0905] GP28 (or any spare).
2025-12-03 15:38:48 [kimi-k2-0905] One PIO SM can drive the whole chain, so you still have a GPIO left for the I²C volume node.
