2025-12-03 18:28:39 [nitro@ryzen5] c64 cartridge port spec for connector
2025-12-03 18:28:47 [grok-code-1] The Commodore 64 expansion port uses a 44-pin (22 per side) card-edge connector with 2.54 mm pitch,
2025-12-03 18:28:47 [grok-code-1] designed for PCBs 0.8–1.57 mm thick. Polarizing slot at pin 22. Common part: TE Connectivity
2025-12-03 18:28:47 [grok-code-1] 745492-2 or Sullins NRAED022VARN-RC. Electrical: 5V TTL, with signals like address/data bus,
2025-12-03 18:28:47 [grok-code-1] control lines (/GAME, /EXROM, etc.), and power. Mechanical: Overall width ~58 mm.
