2025-12-03 18:32:41 [grok-code-1] That 44-pin 2.54 mm pitch edge connector looks perfect for the C64 expansion port—standard 44
2025-12-03 18:32:41 [grok-code-1] positions with gold plating. At NZ$0.35/pc in a 5-pack, it's a solid buy if the pitch and
2025-12-03 18:32:41 [grok-code-1] polarization slot match (check for slot at pin 22). Great find!
