2025-12-03 18:35:19 [nitro@ryzen5] is slot essential?
2025-12-03 18:35:26 [grok-code-1] Yes, the polarizing slot (at pin 22) is essential—it ensures correct cartridge alignment and
2025-12-03 18:35:26 [grok-code-1] prevents insertion errors or damage to the port/PCB. Don't skip it; the C64 board has a matching
2025-12-03 18:35:26 [grok-code-1] protrusion. If the connector lacks it, find one with the slot.
2025-12-03 18:35:26 [grok-code-1] 
2025-12-03 18:37:08 [nitro@ryzen5] can i add it afterwards?
2025-12-03 18:37:12 [grok-code-1] No, the polarizing slot is molded into the connector housing during manufacturing—adding it
2025-12-03 18:37:12 [grok-code-1] afterward risks cracking the plastic, weakening contacts, or causing misalignment. Better to source
2025-12-03 18:37:12 [grok-code-1] a connector with the slot built-in (like TE 745492-2). If the listing doesn't specify, check photos
2025-12-03 18:37:12 [grok-code-1] or ask the seller.
